 perfect for us! The rooms were spacious and inviting. The courtyard was adorable and relaxing. The staff was friendly and accommodating. The location was very convenient! I liked being in a private hotel, not the traditional kind. I felt like I was at a bed and breakfast! I enjoyed having my morning coffee on the patio in front of our apartment. In the afternoon, I would sit by the pool and read a book or take a nap. The ambiance was pleasant overall!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
